WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:04.560
Your son

00:05.000 --> 00:06.400
Understands

00:07.960 --> 00:09.360
Good

00:10.760 --> 00:13.360
This Chu Huan is a loyal and righteous man

00:13.440 --> 00:14.840
Before he goes

00:15.440 --> 00:16.840
Go see him

00:19.400 --> 00:20.800
Yes

00:36.240 --> 00:37.600
Your Highness

00:37.680 --> 00:39.080
You've come

00:54.720 --> 00:56.120
Before acting

00:57.280 --> 00:59.947
Your subject thought he might lose his head

01:00.080 --> 01:01.480
Just didn't think

01:01.600 --> 01:03.933
It would nearly drag Your Highness down

01:06.680 --> 01:07.880
Chu Huan

01:07.960 --> 01:09.360
The order was mine

01:10.200 --> 01:12.200
You've followed me since the north

01:12.520 --> 01:13.920
I

01:16.200 --> 01:18.200
Your subject first followed Your Highness

01:18.440 --> 01:20.107
Only for the prince's salary

01:20.280 --> 01:21.680
Following Your Highness south

01:22.560 --> 01:24.560
Was to preserve life and body

01:25.600 --> 01:27.000
Now your subject

01:27.440 --> 01:29.107
Is guilty before heaven's might

01:29.520 --> 01:30.960
Guilty before the times

01:32.080 --> 01:34.080
Why does Your Highness blame yourself?

01:36.680 --> 01:38.080
The high noble families

01:38.640 --> 01:40.960
Are the mountains connecting all of Jiangnan

01:42.000 --> 01:44.040
Both protecting the current Xuan Kingdom

01:45.320 --> 01:47.280
And keeping the Son of Heaven

01:47.360 --> 01:49.240
From leaving their shadow

01:50.280 --> 01:51.680
Your subject

01:52.000 --> 01:52.800
Since I cannot be

01:52.880 --> 01:54.547
The blade that splits mountains

01:56.440 --> 01:58.107
Then to be Your Highness's

01:58.320 --> 01:59.600
Stepping stone

01:59.680 --> 02:01.080
Is fine

02:03.280 --> 02:04.680
When we went south

02:05.000 --> 02:06.480
Your subject had family and old friends

02:06.640 --> 02:08.040
Left in the north

02:08.600 --> 02:09.680
Under your subject

02:09.760 --> 02:10.680
Are many people

02:10.760 --> 02:12.160
Like your subject

02:16.480 --> 02:18.147
Your Highness once promised me

02:18.800 --> 02:20.200
Them

02:20.960 --> 02:23.240
And the millions of northern people

02:24.680 --> 02:26.080
That one day

02:26.600 --> 02:28.680
We would defeat the Wutu in the north

02:28.760 --> 02:30.160
And recover our land

02:32.960 --> 02:34.360
Is there anything else

02:35.880 --> 02:37.547
You need me to do?

02:38.600 --> 02:40.600
Your subject has a capable student

02:40.840 --> 02:42.240
Named Zhu Yuanzhi

02:44.520 --> 02:45.920
Please, Your Highness

02:46.600 --> 02:48.267
Put him to good use

02:50.760 --> 02:52.160
Certainly

02:57.640 --> 02:59.040
This half journey

02:59.240 --> 03:00.760
To be able to serve Your Highness

03:00.840 --> 03:02.480
Shelter from wind and rain

03:02.560 --> 03:03.960
And block blades

03:04.480 --> 03:05.880
Is Huan's fortune

03:12.880 --> 03:14.280
This cup of wine

03:14.600 --> 03:16.000
Your subject

03:16.160 --> 03:17.560
Deserves

03:20.600 --> 03:22.000
To Your Highness
